Search syntax for {{ tool('search_collections') }}

Plain words must all occur. These operators are available.

  water testing                  both words
  water | sewage                 either word
  water -draft                   exclude draft
  "public water supply"          exact phrase
  "public water"~5               proximity within 5 positions
  "one two three"/2               any 2 words
  water NEAR/3 testing           proximity in either order
  water NOTNEAR/5 testing        exclude nearby testing
  "(water | sewage) plant"        either phrase
  "(water | sewage) plant"~10     either word near plant
  "(water | sewage) plant"/2      quorum with an alternative
  skilling << resigned           strict word order
  (water | sewage) plant         grouping
  water MAYBE sewage             optional ranking word
  water^3 testing                ranking boost
  ^Dear                          start of text
  contract*                      words with this prefix
  *ollution*                     words containing this text
  dasovi?h                       one varying character
  dasovic%                       zero or one character

Use at least 3 letters between infix wildcards. Word forms do not match automatically.
Search contract | contracts or contract* to include both forms.

OR, AND and NOT are ordinary words. Use | and -word.
Read word_counts before changing a name. Suggestions give indexed words and checked document counts.
Use a suggestion only when it is the intended name. Otherwise ask the person or report the absence.
